  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multimodal models (e.g., config_038) outperform rna_only/image_only baselines. The top accuracy (0.7207) uses scvi_n200 RNA encoder, imagenet_vit_l image encoder, transformer aggregation, and concat fusion. This experiment tests whether switching fusion from concat to weighted (a critical design choice) improves performance, while keeping other components consistent. It directly addresses uncertainty about fusion method effectiveness with minimal changes, leveraging strong prior evidence for scvi_n200 and transformer."
